cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Battery Feature Lab, please cite this software."
title: "Battery Feature Lab"
type: software
version: 0.5.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Shiyun"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shiyunliu-battery/Battery-Feature-Lab"
url: "https://github.com/shiyunliu-battery/Battery-Feature-Lab"
license: MPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for battery time-series and electrochemical impedance spectroscopy
  analysis. It represents measurement conditions, observed and model-derived responses,
  and changes across comparable observations as machine-readable records with source
  provenance, method configurations, quality diagnostics, and interpretation limits.
keywords:
  - battery
  - time-series
  - electrochemical impedance spectroscopy
  - EIS
  - electrochemistry
  - battery-data-standard
  - battery-data-format
  - machine-readable analysis
